### Compatible con REST Client de VS Code / HTTP Client de IntelliJ.
### Sustituye los UUID después de cada creación.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/franchises
@franchise = REEMPLAZAR_UUID
@branch = REEMPLAZAR_UUID
@product = REEMPLAZAR_UUID

### 1. Crear franquicia (copiar id)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Café Andino"}

### 2. Crear sucursal (copiar id)
POST {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Chapinero"}

### 3. Crear producto (copiar id)
POST {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches/{{branch}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Café de origen","stock":15}

### 4. Consultar versión actual
GET {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches/{{branch}}/products/{{product}}

### 5. Stock (version debe coincidir con el GET anterior)
PATCH {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches/{{branch}}/products/{{product}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock":80,"version":0}

### 6. Ganador por sucursal
GET {{base}}/{{franchise}}/products/max-stock

### 7. Renombrar franquicia
PATCH {{base}}/{{franchise}}/name
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Café Andino Colombia","version":0}

### 8. Renombrar sucursal
PATCH {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches/{{branch}}/name
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Chapinero Norte","version":0}

### 9. Renombrar producto (stock ya incrementó la versión a 1)
PATCH {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches/{{branch}}/products/{{product}}/name
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Café especial","version":1}

### 10. Eliminar producto
DELETE {{base}}/{{franchise}}/branches/{{branch}}/products/{{product}}

### 11. Salud y documentación
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness

### Contrato OpenAPI
GET http://localhost:8080/openapi.json
